# Public URL of your self-hosted Protomaps basemap (no map API key required).
# Use a basemap-schema-v4 PMTiles archive with data through zoom 15.
# Download a planet archive or create a regional extract covering your users:
# https://docs.protomaps.com/basemaps/downloads
# Copy the archive to your own storage; do not hotlink public demo/build archives.
# The URL pathname must end in .pmtiles. Hosting must support HTTP Range
# requests (206 responses); cross-origin hosting also needs CORS for GET/HEAD,
# Range and If-Match request headers, and an exposed ETag response header.
# https://docs.protomaps.com/pmtiles/cloud-storage
# Copy this file to .env.local and set the URL before starting development.
# In production, set this variable in your hosting environment before building.
# NEXT_PUBLIC variables are public and build-time: never put secrets in this URL.
# Regional extracts only display a basemap within their geographic coverage.
NEXT_PUBLIC_BASEMAP_PMTILES_URL=

# Flight-data API configuration is separate and remains unchanged.
